{"v":4,"catch":"即時城鎮建設玩具","desc":"沒有非達成不可的目標，也沒有必須遵循的遊戲規則。只有無止境的建造和美景，僅此而已。\n\n《Townscaper》是以滿腔熱情為初衷的實驗專案。與其說是遊戲，更像是玩具。從調色板選取顏色，挑選房屋色塊放在不規則的格子裡，然後欣賞遊戲運用基礎演算法，根據不同的配置將色塊自動變成可愛的小屋、拱門、樓梯、橋梁和綠意庭院。","publisher":"Raw Fury","release":"2021-08-26","genres":["模擬","益智","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","葡萄牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","荷蘭文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0e3f34eae037cbb0c22ab93ebc5d540e936721295eae5313b4b3de75633bfbc2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/94f319bf5135346391bc6a12ce85211c0b25c99f6c66a79b7d582561c1f78c79.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/783a31394f954dca94c4ac0be1d76e8179e9a6e85d73664e67e2eee0c77aae75.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fd3ff217b0b71f6bb9757967d15f7435f91506eb6c7aae2addc87d7d79a60ef2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c9bb25d7394d9b9b1e8fa51df31f9d63542aaa26023079c1225d74e120119f4d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1b8bdb375a2d1865df840e85a26ac13a1441dc2015849953b059d8edfedcc478.jpg"],"titleId":"01001260143fc000","dlc":[]}